## Engineering constraints (summary)

- 2D operating radius; ConservativeStep load-chart lookup (no interpolation).
- Single crane specification per GA run; setup points must pass `ConstraintEngine`.
- Background work uses `IDbContextFactory<CraneDbContext>` for thread-safe DB access.
- GA target: ~2–5s for pop 100 / 500 generations; UI at 60 FPS.

When docs and code disagree, **code wins** — then update docs if the user requests it.
